  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 18 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D19"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the heparin sodium shortage on 2017-11-14 and it remains current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E91", "D26"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The shortage listing includes B. Braun Medical Inc., Baxter Healthcare, Fresenius Kabi USA LLC, and Hospira Inc. as affected companies.",
      "cites": ["E87", "E88", "E89", "E90"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hospira's plant (FEI 1925262) was inspected on 2017-10-27 and classified VAI, 18 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D19", "E74"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Baxter's plant (FEI 1025114) was inspected on 2016-02-26 and classified OAI, 627 days before the posting.",
      "cites": ["D15", "E18"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Baxter's plant (FEI 2618677) received a Warning Letter on 2017-02-14, 273 days before the posting.",
      "cites": ["D18", "E49"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from BE Pharmaceuticals Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D27"]
    }
  ]
}
